    "## Step 7: Two different earths, the same data (equivalence)\n",
    "This step uses three synthetic models with the same electrode spacings as your survey. Each has 5 m of 20 Ω·m on top of a **conductive** layer, sitting on 50 Ω·m. The conductive layer is different in each model:\n",
    "\n",
